{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-11-08 11:39:00', 'title': 'MANON BROUILLETTE NAMED CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, VERIZON CONSUMER GROUP', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 08, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY VERIZON COMMUNICATIONS (NYSE, NASDAQ:\xa0VZ) ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF MANON BROUILLETTE TO EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CEO OF VERIZON CONSUMER GROUP EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2022. SHE WILL SUCCEED RONAN DUNNE, WHO WILL TAKE ON THE ROLE OF STRATEGIC ADVISOR. MANON WILL REPORT DIRECTLY TO HANS VESTBERG, VERIZON CHAIRMAN AND CEO.'}